sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Enrollee (user/computer)
  participant DC as Domain Controller (LDAP)
  participant CA as Enterprise CA (Policy Module)
  U->>DC: Read published templates (pKIEnrollmentService)
  DC-->>U: Template list + ACLs
  U->>CA: MS-ICPR request (CSR + template name)
  CA->>CA: Policy check: enroll rights, subject source, EKU
  CA->>CA: Build subject (from AD or from request)
  CA-->>U: Signed certificate
  U->>DC: PKINIT / Schannel auth with certificate
  DC-->>U: TGT (identity = subject/SAN in cert)
